flowchart TD
    A([Create transfer]) --> B[Check balance]
    B --> C{Enough funds?}
    C -->|No| X([Reject])
    C -->|Yes| D{Amount over 500 million?}
    D -->|Yes| E[Send to manager]
    E --> F{Approved?}
    F -->|No| X
    F -->|Yes| G[Verify OTP]
    D -->|No| G
    G --> H{OTP valid?}
    H -->|Wrong| I[Re-enter OTP]
    I --> H
    H -->|Right| J[Post transaction]
    J --> K[(Ledger)]
    J --> L([Succeeded])
    classDef ok fill:#dae8fc,stroke:#6c8ebf
    class L ok
